      "InternalName": "HMSync",
      "Punchline": "Explore any zone together.",
      "Description": "Load any in-game map client-side and explore it solo or with up to 20 friends, behind a packet filter that keeps the server seeing you as idle in your room. Shared weather, BGM and time; client-side mounts, emotes and minions; carpet floors for spots without collision; head-tilt and gaze sync for roleplay; and proximity say/yell passthrough. Co-op needs a relay key (closed beta); solo mode never connects to the relay.",
